[{"text":"PauliSigma[x, dim] is the internal representation of a Pauli matrix with a Lorentz or Cartesian index or a contraction of a Pauli matrix and a Lorentz or Cartesian vector.","anchor":"paulisigma"},{"text":"PauliSigma[x,3] simplifies to PauliSigma[x].","anchor":"paulisigma"},{"text":"Overview, SI, CSI.","anchor":"see-also","section":"See also"},{"text":"PauliSigma[LorentzIndex[\\[Alpha]]]","anchor":"cb1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\bar{\\sigma }^{\\alpha }\\]","anchor":"cb1-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"PauliSigma[CartesianIndex[i]]","anchor":"cb2","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\overline{\\sigma }^i\\]","anchor":"cb2-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"A Pauli matrix contracted with a Lorentz or Cartesian vector is displayed as \\(\\sigma \\cdot p\\)","anchor":"cb2-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"PauliSigma[Momentum[p]]","anchor":"cb3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\bar{\\sigma }\\cdot \\overline{p}\\]","anchor":"cb3-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"PauliSigma[CartesianMomentum[p]]","anchor":"cb4","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\overline{\\sigma }\\cdot \\overline{p}\\]","anchor":"cb4-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"PauliSigma[Momentum[q]] . PauliSigma[Momentum[p - q]] % // PauliSigmaExpand","anchor":"cb5","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\left(\\bar{\\sigma }\\cdot \\overline{q}\\right).\\left(\\bar{\\sigma }\\cdot \\left(\\overline{p}-\\overline{q}\\right)\\right)\\]","anchor":"cb5-3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\left(\\bar{\\sigma }\\cdot \\overline{q}\\right).\\left(\\bar{\\sigma }\\cdot \\overline{p}-\\bar{\\sigma }\\cdot \\overline{q}\\right)\\]","anchor":"cb5-3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"PauliSigma[CartesianMomentum[q]] . PauliSigma[CartesianMomentum[p - q]] % // PauliSigmaExpand","anchor":"cb6","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\left(\\overline{\\sigma }\\cdot \\overline{q}\\right).\\left(\\overline{\\sigma }\\cdot \\left(\\overline{p}-\\overline{q}\\right)\\right)\\]","anchor":"cb6-3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\left(\\overline{\\sigma }\\cdot \\overline{q}\\right).\\left(\\overline{\\sigma }\\cdot \\overline{p}-\\overline{\\sigma }\\cdot \\overline{q}\\right)\\]","anchor":"cb6-3","section":"Examples"}]